     2| * Owner-gated HTTP surface for the IVX self-hosted Senior Developer Worker.
     3| *
     4| * These endpoints let IVX IA (or the owner directly) submit and track real
     5| * development tasks WITHOUT Rork acting as the executor. Every mutating route
     6| * requires a verified registered-owner bearer (or the system key). The worker
     7| * itself runs the real GitHub/Render/test pipeline.
